{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52496","headline":"幽兰之歌 · 杨炯","name":"幽兰之歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽兰生矣，于彼朝阳。\n含雨露之津润，吸日月之休光。\n美人愁思兮，采芙蓉於南浦；公子忘忧兮，树萱草於北堂。\n虽处幽林与穷谷，不以无人而不芳。\n（《杨盈川集》卷一《幽兰赋》附）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}